flowchart LR
  accTitle: 多环境软件交付流水线
  accDescr: 从提交进入并行检查，构建签名制品，经过预发布验收后灰度发布；失败走修复或回滚路径。
  subgraph source[代码与验证]
    direction TB
    commit[提交变更] --> review{代码审核}
    review -->|退回| fix[修复问题]
    fix --> commit
    review -->|通过| unit[单元测试]
    review -->|通过| types[类型检查]
    review -->|通过| scan[依赖扫描]
    unit --> gate{质量门禁}
    types --> gate
    scan --> gate
  end
  subgraph artifact[制品与预发布]
    direction TB
    build[构建制品] --> sign[签名与摘要]
    sign --> registry[(制品仓库)]
    registry --> staging[部署预发布]
    staging --> smoke[冒烟与契约测试]
    smoke --> accept{验收通过}
  end
  subgraph release[渐进发布与反馈]
    direction TB
    canary[灰度 5%] --> metrics{指标正常}
    metrics -->|是| expand[逐步扩大流量]
    expand --> production[全量发布]
    metrics -->|否| rollback[恢复上一制品]
    production --> observe[监控与审计]
  end
  gate -->|通过| build
  gate -->|失败| fix
  accept -->|通过| canary
  accept -->|失败| fix
  rollback -.-> fix
  classDef good fill:#e5f1eb,stroke:#559478,color:#204b3a
  classDef risk fill:#fbede7,stroke:#cc765b,color:#743e2d
  class production,observe good
  class fix,rollback risk
